On Friday evening I am standing in front of the office.
The weather forecast was good.
That is why I rode my bicycle to work this morning.
Now I unlock my bicycle.
I put my laptop in my backpack.
Normally I take the U-Bahn home.
But today I am taking my time.
The weekend is finally beginning.
I cycle slowly through the lively streets.
The sun is still high in the sky.
The light is golden and very bright.
It is pleasantly warm, even now in the evening.
Everywhere people are sitting outside.
They are drinking something or eating an ice cream.
I enjoy the long ride home.
A mild wind blows through the green trees.
I feel completely relaxed.
The city is so beautiful in the summer.
I look forward to my quiet evening in the flat.
